            "notes": "The key concept of this deck is to assemble a powerful combo using Prossh, Skyraider of Kher as the commander. The deck includes various mana ramp cards like Arbor Elf, Birds of Paradise, and Sylvan Caryatid to quickly generate mana and cast Prossh early in the game. The deck also features cards like Purphoros, God of the Forge and Goblin Bombardment to deal damage to opponents when Prossh enters the battlefield or when his tokens are sacrificed. By using cards like Eldritch Evolution and Finale of Devastation to tutor for key pieces of the combo, the deck aims to overwhelm opponents with a swarm of tokens and burn them out for a quick victory."
